      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think caching is a good idea given the enablement of code owners plugin should never changes. However, I\u0027m wondering if there\u0027s any particular reason to cache the result in git config rather than in memory (e.g. using @functools.lru_cache decorator) ?",
      "revId": "868f9487ab573bdd08a2d991c1dada73835417fb",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
