        "id": 4323820
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-12-05T18:31:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was thinking it would be nice to persist on disk somewhere, and the git config is a convenient place to store it per-repository. If we store it in memory, we\u0027ll have to make the call once every presubmit time we run a script?",
