      "writtenOn": "2025-12-05T21:51:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That also might not work well with non-git environment. Stepping back a little bit, it looks like we did cache the result at [the caller](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/tools/depot_tools/+/main:presubmit_support.py;l\u003d598-602;drc\u003d2e88a3f08bd8c4a0014eae82729beca935f7f188). Therefore, it should just make the call once for each presubmit run. Are you saying that the call itself could just take 1.5s?",
      "parentUuid": "10bc0b45_ddb7f9da",
      "revId": "868f9487ab573bdd08a2d991c1dada73835417fb",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
